		"description": "<p>At 10th level, your artifact allows you to weave defensive measures onto additional targets. When you cast a spell as a reaction to attacks or damage for yourself or for an ally within your aura of command, all allies within your aura of command gain a bonus to AC and Saving Throws equal to your Charisma modifier until the start of your next turn.</p><p>This bonus includes the triggering attack for spells like @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-spells.Item.t4s0j5c67vswwq04]{Force of Will}.</p>",
